#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/whois.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can install the <command>whois</command> program, the "
"<command>mkpasswd</command> program, and the locale files independently.  "
"Control your choice of what is installed with the following commands issued "
"as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Você consegue instalar o aplicativo &quot;<command>whois</command>&quot;, o "
"aplicativo &quot;<command>mkpasswd</command>&quot; e os arquivos de "
"localidade independentemente. Controle a tua escolha do que será instalado "
"com os seguintes comandos emitidos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/whois.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Installing this version of <command>mkpasswd</command> will overwrite the "
"same command installed in LFS."
msgstr ""
"Instalar essa versão do &quot;<command>mkpasswd</command>&quot; "
"sobrescreverá o mesmo comando instalado no LFS."

